            <h1><span class="en">A little less plan.<br/>A lot more <span class="accent">Fun.</span></span><span class="zh">不一定有计划，<br/>但一定有故事。</span></h1>
            <p class="lead en">A personal travel journal for curious detours, unexpected discoveries and the stories collected along the way.</p>
            <p class="lead zh">记录每一段旅程、每一次随性出发，以及那些意想不到的风景与故事。</p>
            <p class="tagline en">CYan Travel Journal · Travel your way.</p>
