        <section id="about">
          <div class="about">
            <div class="about-copy">
              <div class="about-kicker"><span class="en">THE INSPIRATION BEHIND CYAN</span><span class="zh">CYAN 的灵感由来</span></div>
              <h2><span class="en">A journal shaped by curiosity.</span><span class="zh">因好奇而出发的旅行日志。</span></h2>
              <p class="en">The name “CYan” is a playful nod to the Chinese words “虾” (xiā) and “瞎” (xiā), which share the same pronunciation. It reflects my love of travel, the freedom to explore, a sense of adventure and the joy of discovering something new along the way.</p>
              <p class="en">Life is about balance — making time for work, making room for exploration and enjoying the moments in between.</p>
              <p class="en">Travel the world, explore freely and discover something unexpected in every moment. This journal is a place to collect life’s little discoveries and the memories worth remembering.</p>
              <p class="en">As the Chinese saying goes, “读万卷书，不如行万里路” — reading widely opens our minds, but exploring the world gives us lessons and experiences of our own.</p>
              <p class="zh">“CYan” 是一个有趣的谐音巧思，灵感来自中文“虾”和“瞎”（xiā）。这个名字带着一点俏皮，也表达了我对旅行的热爱、探索的自由、冒险的精神，以及一路上发现新鲜事物的乐趣。</p>
              <p class="zh">生活讲求平衡——认真工作，也要留些时间给自己，去探索世界、享受生活中的点滴。</p>
              <p class="zh">走出去看看世界，自由探索，在每一段旅程、每一个当下发现意想不到的惊喜。这本旅行日志记录生活中的小发现，以及那些值得珍藏的回忆。</p>
              <p class="zh">正如那句老话：“读万卷书，不如行万里路。”阅读让我们开阔眼界，而亲身走过的路，则带来书本之外的体验与领悟。</p>
